---
// Hero Section
---

<header class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center pt-24 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-surface via-surface/80 to-transparent z-10"></div>
    <img
      class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale opacity-40"
      alt="Monolithic architectural detail of a supreme court building with deep shadows and sharp stone edges in low key lighting"
      src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDgonvXdLr69N6DGOR1YQz-gZ7969kq46NUFbWKa9K4f7iAexKdcrqK8j5bNBs2vI1YKoutKMlUJc7oA1zDpcp-Z1gZj88Kw-3XPUNWpgyL-Y0jJpvuWutApyu8Bu6tHtNuxoYJGCr8ztop9kNNO5Y10ZzJkb1azcJa_YDeC6C5-utK_um6-ZTYysXkmW4r718k1Pm5XTT7GGW2tiL08b65O8zmzJ4grL8f5gLM4KpgZioSGZL3nSwqmenQ8TFcVdeAZw72mGPUhmg"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="relative z-20 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-16 w-full grid grid-cols-12">
    <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-8">
      <span class="label-md uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary mb-6 block font-label text-xs">A Legacy of High-Stakes Advocacy</span>
      <h1 class="font-headline text-[4.5rem] md:text-[6rem] leading-[0.9] tracking-tighter text-on-surface mb-8">The Final Word in <br/>Complex Litigation.</h1>
      <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-xl max-w-lg mb-12 leading-relaxed font-body">Defending institutional interests with architectural precision and unyielding legal strategy.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-8">
        <button class="bg-primary text-on-primary px-10 py-4 font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-sm hover:brightness-110 transition-all">Secure Counsel</button>
        <a class="text-primary border-b-2 border-secondary font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-sm flex items-center gap-2" href="#">
          View Our Record <span class="material-symbols-outlined">arrow_forward</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
